      "is_error_case": false,
      "judgment_call": false,
      "reasoning": "Originally worded as requiring real Draft-07 JSON Schema validation, but this is not currently buildable: no jsonschema validation crate is a workspace dependency, no schema files exist anywhere in this repo, the real Draft-07 schemas for these 5 IDs live in a separate sibling repo (agent-plugins/shared/schemas/), and eval-report@1 specifically has no schema file in ANY repo yet. Reworded to describe the actual buildable heuristic (JSON-block presence, not payload validation) per TASK-ANALYSIS-002s implementation. Real Draft-07 validation is a separate follow-up requiring the cross-repo schema dependency question to be resolved first."
