180	          <div class="area-desc">Added parallel execution, cancellation, and half-open single-flight gating to the michi-pipeline crate. Claude orchestrated a long series of TDD tasks through sub-agents, landing changes cleanly with a growing green test suite that reached 77/77. One rustdoc intra-doc link pointed at a not-yet-existing function and briefly broke the doc-warnings CI gate before being fixed.</div>
