188	          <div class="area-desc">Publishing prep for a Rust+TypeScript monorepo using Callisto, plus root-causing CI/Release failures traced to a version-sync mismatch from missing npm publish config. Claude validated configuration against the real CLI rather than assumptions, and after the user demanded adversarial re-verification it found a silent match-pattern bug where callisto.toml used directory paths that never matched. Also included spec restructuring for NAPI numeric boundary work.</div>
