  },
  {
    "id": "CRIT-LUMEN-165",
    "criterion": "WHEN AgyAdapter locates a session's real transcript, THE SYSTEM SHALL read from ~/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/<conversation-id>/.system_generated/logs/transcript.jsonl directly (or an equivalent already-resolved path) rather than through the ~/.gemini/logs/<id>.jsonl symlink layer, since the symlink is a convenience flattening view, not a guaranteed-present source in every install. THE SYSTEM SHALL treat the sibling ~/.gemini/logs/<id>.json (no \"l\") summary file -- a structurally different, precomputed Gemini-API role/parts[].text shape -- as out of scope for this adapter (see non_goals).",
    "is_error_case": false,
    "judgment_call": true,
    "reasoning": "Provenance fully resolved this session: Google discontinued Gemini CLI for Antigravity CLI (2026-05-19/06-18 transition per Google's own developer blog), and ~/.gemini/logs/*.jsonl was confirmed via direct ls -la on this machine to be a symlink farm into antigravity-cli/brain/, not an independent source."
  },
  {
    "id": "CRIT-LUMEN-166",
    "criterion": "WHEN a session file's first 2048 bytes contain the JSON key \"usageMetadata\" with nested promptTokenCount/candidatesTokenCount/thoughtsTokenCount/cachedContentTokenCount/totalTokenCount fields, and no ClaudeCode, Antigravity, Codex, or OpenCode fingerprint markers matched first, THE SYSTEM SHALL identify the orchestrator as OrchestratorKind::Qwen via detect_orchestrator, reading real session files from ~/.qwen/projects/<project>/chats/<file>.jsonl.",
    "is_error_case": false,
    "judgment_call": true,
    "reasoning": "New orchestrator support: ccusage's real Qwen adapter confirms Qwen Code is a real, distinct, actively-used format whose usage fields are named identically to Google's Gemini API response schema (confirming Qwen Code's CLI lineage is Gemini-CLI-derived) -- previously entirely unrepresented; OrchestratorKind (crates/lumen-model/src/transcript.rs:27-34) needs a new Qwen variant added alongside the existing ClaudeCode/Antigravity/Codex/OpenCode/Kimi/GenericOtel set."
  }
],

